    exampleHands: [
      'Opening deal: 2-4 player(s), 7 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in play; each_player_clockwise may use play_card before round end.',
      "Scoring check: Whenever a player makes the open ends of the layout total a multiple of five, they score that total; the winner of the hand (the player who dominoes or has the fewest pips when the game blocks) scores the total pip value of opponents' remaining tiles, often divided by five into points or chips. Expected outcome: Play continues over multiple hands, and the first player to reach the agreed total of points or chips wins..",
